WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:06.880
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain a comedy sci-fi film called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:15.920
“The World Sinks Except Japan”.&nbsp;
Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:24.480
Two Japanese men, Goto and Koga are in a bar after&nbsp;
a long day at work. They make fun of an American&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:30.560
performer singing in a horrible Japanese accent.&nbsp;
Recently, Japan has been flooded with foreigners&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:36.320
from around the world moving into the country. The&nbsp;
president of America is sitting beside the two in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:41.120
the bar. Hearing them making fun of his people,&nbsp;
the politician interrupts their conversation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:45.600
He claims that Japanese people should be patient&nbsp;
with the American immigrants because they are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:51.920
trying their best to learn the language. Goto&nbsp;
disagrees because language is not the only issue.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:57.520
He claims that America has the highest crime&nbsp;
rate in the world. Humiliated by the civilians,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:03.280
the president insults the entire country of Japan&nbsp;
but stops when the president of Japan arrives at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:09.120
the club. It turns out that all the presidents and&nbsp;
higher officials of the world are in the club. 
&nbsp;

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:15.120
A flashback shows us Goto with his American wife&nbsp;
Catherine. The two are a happy couple and living&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:21.520
in Tokyo. Goto narrates that the night when he was&nbsp;
enjoying his time with his wife was a horrible one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:26.960
for the rest of the world. The movement of the&nbsp;
tectonic plates under the earth caused massive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:33.840
earthquakes and tsunamis. At first, the entire&nbsp;
continent of America sank underwater and only the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:39.120
rich managed to escape drowning in the ocean. 
In a Japanese broadcasting company,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:45.520
the news spreads like a wildfire, making everyone&nbsp;
panic. The president of America presents his final&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:51.360
statement on the matter through a live broadcast&nbsp;
on a plane. He asks the citizens to keep calm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:56.880
because the neighboring nations will help them in&nbsp;
time of need. As he talks, a half-dressed woman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:01.920
serves him a drink, but the president seems&nbsp;
to ignore that. While the country is sinking,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:08.080
he sings a song about America being the greatest&nbsp;
nation in the world. The Japanese officials watch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:13.200
the live show in awe. They also find out&nbsp;
that he is heading to a base in Okinawa,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:18.000
Japan. They are ready to take in American&nbsp;
refugees as a gesture of friendship. 
&nbsp;

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:22.320
Goto also works in the same office and&nbsp;
is arguing with his wife on the phone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:27.360
She wants to return to America because she is&nbsp;
worried about her family in Texas. Little does&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:33.520
she know, the mass of land that was one Texas is&nbsp;
now under the ocean. At the house of parliament,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:38.640
Professor Tadokoro tells the president about&nbsp;
a mantle plume under the surface of the earth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:44.720
that still has energy and is ready to erupt. He&nbsp;
begins explaining everything about the mantle but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:50.160
doesn’t get to the point. When the president asks&nbsp;
him what is going to happen next, he falls asleep&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:55.600
and has to be woken up. After a long chat, he&nbsp;
is about to reveal the conclusion, but at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.600 --> 00:03:01.520
same time, their meeting is interrupted.
Somewhere else, Oscar-winning actor, Jerry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:07.440
Cruising and his actress girlfriend Elizabeth&nbsp;
land in Japan. Although their entire country&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:12.000
has drowned, they seem to be excited about&nbsp;
their new life. Jerry believes that since&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:17.200
he is world-famous, the Japanese film industry&nbsp;
will offer him millions to be in their movie.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.200 --> 00:03:23.200
Elizabeth is just as excited, so much so that she&nbsp;
can’t help but call Japanese people racial slurs.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:28.080
They are interviewed by the reports about&nbsp;
the situation in America before they left.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:33.760
Jerry pretends to be sad but swiftly changes&nbsp;
the subject to his Oscar. Koga is one of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:38.960
reporters interviewing them. He asks Jerry to&nbsp;
be in a Japanese drama his broadcasting company&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:44.560
is shooting next month. The actor happily agrees&nbsp;
to be in the show. In the following scene, Goto&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:50.480
returns home to Catherine who is worried about her&nbsp;
family in America. He assures her they are okay&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:55.680
since millions of people have fled to different&nbsp;
parts of Asia and Europe as refugees. 
&nbsp;

00:03:55.680 --> 00:04:00.880
Meanwhile, Koga also reaches home to his wife.&nbsp;
They have dinner together while talking about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:06.800
the price of food skyrocketing after imports&nbsp;
from the US ended. Koga excitedly tells her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:11.520
about his meeting with Jerry. They assume that&nbsp;
because of the actors, Japanese cinema will be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:16.640
as successful as Hollywood. For the first&nbsp;
few weeks, Americans are welcomed to Japan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:22.480
wholeheartedly. People donate to American refugee&nbsp;
charities and aid them as much as possible.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:28.720
One day, a man holding bowls of Chinese noodles&nbsp;
falls off a bicycle. As the dish drops into a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:35.440
ditch, the entire nation of China sinks under the&nbsp;
ocean. Similarly, a woman drops a Baguette on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:42.480
ditch causing France and entire Europe to sink.&nbsp;
Eventually, all countries sink underwater, leaving&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:48.640
Japan as the only landmass on earth. Almost ninety&nbsp;
percent of the population of earth die because of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:54.480
the impact. In addition, the population of&nbsp;
Japan increases at an exponential rate. 
&nbsp;

00:04:54.480 --> 00:05:00.080
It is now a few years later after Japan became&nbsp;
the sole country in the world. The Americans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:06.080
living in Japan have gone completely broke. Famous&nbsp;
American actors do tricks for Japanese businessmen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:11.600
for money. The Korean and Chinese presidents&nbsp;
turn into minions of the Japanese president&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:16.720
so he would allow their refugees more freedom.&nbsp;
Somewhere else the professor tells his students&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:22.640
that the tectonic plates still have some energy&nbsp;
left which is very soon going to do something big.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:29.200
As usual, he explains all the unnecessary details&nbsp;
passionately but forgets to get to the conclusion.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:35.040
Instead, he dances away from the class, leaving&nbsp;
his students wondering. One day on his way to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:41.120
work, Goto realizes that his country has more&nbsp;
foreigners than its own people. He is on a train&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:46.240
with hundreds of people and not one Japanese&nbsp;
person in sight. He tries to move around the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:51.600
crowded place and locks eyes with a Japanese&nbsp;
man. Both of them look at each other knowingly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:56.560
but can do nothing about the situation. 
In addition, the Japanese yen becomes the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.560 --> 00:06:02.000
strongest currency making any other currency&nbsp;
in the world worth pennies. As the prices of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:07.280
food hike, the refugees resort to begging,&nbsp;
stealing, and looting. Jerry stars in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:12.720
high-budget Japanese movie. People had thought&nbsp;
the rise in the American population would make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:18.560
the movie a hit. But they soon realize that the&nbsp;
target audience cannot even afford a TV. 
&nbsp;

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:23.600
Jerry loses his job, along with Elizabeth.&nbsp;
They hand their landlord bundles of US&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:30.080
dollars but because of inflation, it is still not&nbsp;
enough. Eventually, the once Oscar-winning actors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:36.240
go homeless. In the meantime, the Japanese grow&nbsp;
richer in comparison to most of the population.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:42.720
Koga and his wife are shown eating different&nbsp;
delicacies like whale and tiger meat. His wife&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:46.960
informs him that she is pregnant. The&nbsp;
couple is overjoyed by the good news,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:51.440
mostly because the birth of the child will&nbsp;
bring one more Japanese into the country.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:57.280
The following day on his way to work, Koga sees&nbsp;
Elizabeth and takes her out for lunch. She appears&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:02.800
to be starving as she devours her food and eats&nbsp;
from his plate as well. The actress complains&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:08.640
about not getting any jobs and going homeless. 
To make her feel better, Koga claims that he will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:14.560
find her a job no matter what. However, he knows&nbsp;
that no director wants to cast Americans in their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:20.640
movies after the disaster with Jerry’s last film.&nbsp;
Somewhere else, the professor is enjoying his time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:25.360
with foreign women who have agreed to be his&nbsp;
mistresses for money. One of his students is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:30.800
waiting for him to explain the functioning of the&nbsp;
tectonic plates as the man flirts with the women.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:36.560
The professor explains his theory using sexual&nbsp;
examples but stops before coming to a conclusion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:42.080
yet again. When asked about his wife, he&nbsp;
gets mad and chases the student away.
&nbsp;

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:47.920
Meanwhile, Elizabeth also turns into a prostitute&nbsp;
to earn money. She charges extra money because of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:54.480
her status but men do not mind paying. However,&nbsp;
her relationship with Jerry deteriorates because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:59.680
of her new profession. Goto’s wife Catherine&nbsp;
is furious at the Japanese government for not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:05.120
providing her people with proper facilities. Since&nbsp;
Goto doesn’t care about the foreign policies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:10.480
she gets mad at him as well. On top of&nbsp;
that, he suggests they hire foreign maids&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:15.600
since they are affordable and make you look&nbsp;
rich. Catherine is strictly against the idea&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:21.280
but Goto plans to do it nonetheless. The&nbsp;
actor Jerry, on the other hand, is living&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:25.680
in the streets with the other refugees. 
When Elizabeth returns home late from work,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:31.680
he asks her where she was. She bluntly claims that&nbsp;
she was with a customer. She even suggests he join&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:37.040
the business, asking him to be more productive&nbsp;
since he does nothing all day. They get into a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:43.440
massive argument amidst which, Elizabeth breaks&nbsp;
his Oscar award that he loved more than his life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:48.720
The two break up after the fight. When the crime&nbsp;
rate increases, the president of Japan appoints&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:54.640
the defense general as the head of an anti-refugee&nbsp;
organization. Several soldiers are then sent out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.640 --> 00:09:00.160
to look for illegal refugees and leave them in the&nbsp;
middle of the ocean in the name of deporting them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:05.600
Those who do not follow the law or adjust to&nbsp;
Japan’s way of living will also be deported. 
&nbsp;

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:09.680
The main aim of the government is to&nbsp;
throw out as many foreigners as possible,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:13.600
so they will not consider re-checking&nbsp;
the documents, even if a person is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:19.280
falsely reported to be an illegal immigrant. The&nbsp;
presidents of the other nations know this, hence,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:24.000
they try to stop the bill. But the Japanese&nbsp;
president is adamant about his decision.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:29.920
He even makes the other presidents dance to a&nbsp;
kid’s song about Japan’s greatness. Soon, several&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:34.480
illegal immigrants are caught. They start to&nbsp;
complain against each other after the government&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:39.680
offers rice cakes to those who inform them of&nbsp;
the illegal people. Several innocent and legal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:45.600
ones are also deported because of the rule. Jerry&nbsp;
has started to work for a brothel for money. 
&nbsp;

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:51.280
One day, Catherine sees him on the sideway and&nbsp;
recognizes him as her childhood celebrity crush.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:56.160
At first, Jerry thinks she is making fun of&nbsp;
him like everyone. After he finds out that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.160 --> 00:10:01.280
is genuinely happy to see him, he opens up to&nbsp;
her about his situation. The policemen find it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:06.800
suspicious and ask Catherine for identification.&nbsp;
When they see she is a Japanese man’s wife,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:11.440
they let her go. Catherine hands Jerry the&nbsp;
grocery she had just bought when he says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:17.280
he has nothing to eat. When Goto returns home&nbsp;
that day, he is welcomed by his foreign maids.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:22.320
They help him change into pajamas and even go to&nbsp;
the bathroom with him in case he needs something.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:26.000
Since Catherine didn’t shop for tonight’s&nbsp;
dinner, they couldn’t cook anything. 
&nbsp;

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:31.040
A furious Goto asks his wife why she didn’t&nbsp;
buy food like she was supposed to. The couple&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:36.960
gets into an argument which escalates when Goto&nbsp;
slaps Catherine. She storms out of the house,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:42.320
saying that she is leaving him. The following&nbsp;
day, Goto happens to see her on his way to work.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:48.080
She is arguing with the deportation police who&nbsp;
are trying to take Jerry away. Goto interferes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:53.200
and asks her why she is trying to save a stranger.&nbsp;
Catherine then admits that she is in love with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:59.040
Jerry and wants to go with him, even if it means&nbsp;
ending up in the ocean. Her husband is shocked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:04.400
but he can do nothing to change her mind. 
In a bar, the presidents of China and Korea are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:09.200
dancing to entertain the president of Japan. They&nbsp;
have completely given up on fighting for equal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:13.840
rights for their people. Instead, they now dance&nbsp;
for the president in hopes that he will provide&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:18.960
them with food and shelter. The waiters of the bar&nbsp;
seem to be planning something in secret as they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:24.320
hand each other parcels. One of them brings out&nbsp;
a gun from a flush tank that they have smuggled.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:29.840
They take the weapons to the president’s cabin and&nbsp;
hold them hostage. Soon, they take over the entire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:35.840
bar and hold everyone at gunpoint. Koga and Goto,&nbsp;
who were there to get a drink, are shocked.
&nbsp;

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:40.880
The waiters then reveal that they are actually the&nbsp;
North Korean leader and his soldiers who plan to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:46.480
rule Japan. The Japanese president says that their&nbsp;
defense general is not going to let that happen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:52.160
since their military is bigger than North&nbsp;
Korea’s. Meanwhile, the defense general is also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:58.240
held hostage by North Korean spies. Seeing that&nbsp;
he is about to die, he detonates an explosive,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:03.600
blowing up the entire building. Back at the&nbsp;
club, the dictator is celebrating his victory&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:09.520
when professor Tadokoro appears riding on a kid’s&nbsp;
tricycle out of nowhere. He tells them about the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:15.760
tectonic plates yet again. However, this time, he&nbsp;
completes his sentence and reveals that in only a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:21.840
few minutes, Japan is also going to sink under&nbsp;
the sea, ending the existence of mankind. 
&nbsp;

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:26.960
Right after he gets done, a massive earthquake&nbsp;
hits. Everyone falls to the ground and starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:31.680
praying for their lives. People fight with each&nbsp;
other for no reason since everyone is going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:38.080
to die anyway. Suddenly, the lights go off. The&nbsp;
people in the club come together to light a candle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:38.080 --> 00:12:43.840
and gather around it. In the background, it is&nbsp;
narrated that at least in the last moment, world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:51.360
peace exists. Soon, another earthquake hits which&nbsp;
makes the land of Japan sink under the ocean. At&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:59.680
last, no humans are left on earth. 
